Package: asgard-games
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: metapackages
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 asgard-gnome-desktop,
 gnome-games,
 transmission-gtk
Description: @DISTRIBUTION@ casual games + BitTorrent
 Light entertainment layer on top of the base desktop:
 .
   * gnome-games       GNOME casual game bundle — mahjong, sudoku,
                       chess, mines, solitaire variants etc.  The
                       gnome-games metapackage upstream pulls each
                       individual game by Depends.
   * transmission-gtk  BitTorrent client with GTK UI
 .
 Most opinionated subcategory — desktop distros split on whether
 games belong on a default install.  Shipped as an opt-in
 metapackage so the operator decides.
 .
 Selecting this metapackage automatically pulls asgard-gnome-desktop.
